      "title": "profinet: Don't return -1 as failure when callers don't expect it",
      "message": "profinet: Don't return -1 as failure when callers don't expect it\n\nAmend the test added in 66124e4766dc1c66dce6f781d18ccb943aa84313\nto return the end offset instead of -1, which no caller expected.\nAvoid hiding an item. Get rid of some useless subtracting then\nadding back 2.\n\nCoverity CID 1676243\n",
